        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Sagittarius &mdash; 1st (Signature) Technique, gained at level 1.</em></p><p><em>You draw a bow that is not there and loose an arrow that does not miss for reasons of distance.</em></p><p>Make a spell attack roll against the target's AC. The arrow ignores cover and concealment.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Double damage.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> @Damage[2d6[force]] damage.</p><p>Golden Arrow has a range increment of 500 feet.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
